      "jp": "はぁっ……はぁ、こ、これでいいですか！？\nスライムを集めてきましたよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "e45df20e4e37c331343e9c88fdf09b7bde3742b8fb5b5f25f208a6374e869d76",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "헉…… 헉, 이, 이러면 됐나요!?\n슬라임을 모아 왔어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
