    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "944e718841e2763323dd1d50dcc296161b877360f641f10aadcaedbffee28fff",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "おう、それなら……。\nこのスライムに、さっきご主人が着ていた服の\n切れ端を取りこませて――。",
      "jp_sha256": "623506eed1f6ded2fa85776b2dfbbcd53eaf7cb623f3f2eaf93ace749435497a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그래, 그러면…….\n이 슬라임에게 아까 주인이 입고 있던 옷의\n조각을 흡수시키고――.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "f99d53c5f9922ce29fb4e9ea355ff2d9f40240cdbdf32ae599a0a64111431893:000000_-4802233085961353349:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ベルティオ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "おう、それなら……。\nこのスライムに、さっきご主人が着ていた服の\n切れ端を取りこませて――。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ベルティオ",
