        "主人公",
        "<Off>",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "――ふぅ。ようやく落ち着けましたよ。\nシャツと短パンだけっていうのが、ちょっとアレですけど。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "51f8420cbd96e25e4dbb1e132782bed2708db6f1737d460d5e47794c49abf9ee",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それはそれで似合っているわよ。\nほら、ドヘンタイ娘。さっさと船を造りなさい。",
      "jp_sha256": "35714e03f4d3c378f669acba0e9606c3338fff84c1aa59a3f7f4cdb360e20f5a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그건 그것대로 잘 어울려.\n자, 변태 소녀. 얼른 배나 만들어.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b014-20261109-same-model-pass2-501bd9d2-hold15",
